.TH QORE-ONNX 1 "September 2026" "Qore" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
qore-onnx \- inspect, prepare, and validate ONNX models
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qore-onnx
.RI [ options ] " command"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B qore-onnx
provides the command-line interface to the QoreOnnxTools module.
Commands include inspect, validate, benchmark, compare, profile, optimize,
quantize, and check-python. Run with
.B --help
for the complete command and option list.
.PP
Available operations depend on the installed ONNX Runtime and Python tools.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-i , " \-\-input=" file
Specify the input model.
.TP
.BR \-o , " \-\-output=" file
Specify the output file.
.TP
.BR \-J , " \-\-json"
Use JSON output.
.TP
.BR \-h , " \-\-help"
Show commands and options.
.TP
.BR \-V , " \-\-version"
Show the tool version.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR qore (1)
